<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">Daniel</book>
  <para style="h">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Daniel</para>
  <para style="mt">Daniel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Jehoakim vaihawm kum thum kum in Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar hong kuan in Jerusalem a hongum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan Toupa’n Judah kumpipa Jehoakim a khut ah a pia a, Pathian in a tuium-belsuan khenkhat toh; aman Sinar gam ah a pathian inn ah huaite a pita hi: huchi in tuium belsuante a pathian sumkoihna inn ah a lalutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a michilgehte heutupa Aspenaz, Israel tate lak a kuate hiam, kumpi chite a kipan leh milian te a kipan honpi ding in a kiang ah thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuailaite amau a gensiatna omlou, himahleh hoihtak a deihsakna tang leh, pilna tengteng a siamtheihna leh pilna theihsiamna lungpilte, kumpipa Inpi ading thei ding, huchibang mite; huchi a Kaldai laisiamna leh pau amaute a sinsak theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n amau ni teng tantuan ding in kumpipa an leh a dawn uain a kipan in a sehsak a, huchi a kum thum vakthau a a omtheihna ding un; huchi a huai hun bei chiang a kumpipa ma a adin theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in hiaite lak ah, Judah tate a kipan, Daniel, Hananiah, Misael leh Azariah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Michilgehte heutupa’n amaute min ding a phuahsaka; Daniel min ding in Belteshazzar; Hananiah min ding in Sadrak; Misael min ding in Meshak leh Azariah min ding in Abednego a phuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh Daniel in kumpipa an hiam a dawn uain hiam a ki hihnit louh a lungtang in a tum chiltel hi. Huaiziak in michilgeh heutupa kiang ah a ki hihnit louhna ding in a ngenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian in Daniel michilgehte heutupa mitmuh in deihsakna leh lainatna a musak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan michilgehte heutupa’n Daniel kiang ah, “Ka toupa kumpipa na an uleh na dawn uh seppa ka kihta: bangding in na khanvual pih uh tuailaite sang a na mel uh hoihlou zaw a honmu ding ahia oi? Huchi in kumpipa lak ah ka lutang na lauthawngsak dia hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Daniel in sumkempa, michilgehte heutupa’n Daniel, Hananiah, Misael leh Azariah tung a a sehpa kiang ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Na sikhate ni sawm sung enkhia in, k’on ngen hi; nek ding in anteh louhing leh dawn ding in tui honpia uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaichiang in na ma ah ka mel uleh amau kumpipa annete tuailaite mel et hi hen; na muh bang in, na sikhate tung ah hih in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in amau thu a ngaikhia a, ni sawm sung a enkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni sawm a bei in tuailai kumpipa annete tengteng sang in a mel uh hoihzaw in a kilang a, a sa uh leng a thau zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in sumkempa’n a an uleh a dawn ding uh uain a lamang a, amaute kiang ah anteh louhing a pe zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiai tuailai lite a hih uleh Pathian in amaute kiang ah laisiamna leh pilna tengteng a theihna leh kivakna a pia a: huchi in Daniel in mengmuhna leh mang tengteng ah theihsiamna a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa’n amaute hon pilut ding a chih nite a bei in michilgehte heutupa’n amaute Nebukadnezzar ma ah a honpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa’n amau a houlimpih a; amau lak ah Daniel, Hananiah Misael leh Azariah bang kuamah muh in a omta kei hi: huaiziak in kumpipa ma ah a dingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in pilna leh theihsiamna thu chiteng, amaute kumpipa’n a dotte ah a gamsung a om mitkhialdawi tawi leh bummi tengteng sang in a mun sawm a hoihzaw in amaute a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Daniel kumpipa Kura kum khat vaihawm tanpha hial in a paisuak tou hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebukadnezzar vaihawm kum nih kum in Nebukadnezzar in mang a nei a; a lungsim a buai mahmah a, a ihmu theita kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa’n mitkhialdawitawi leh, bummi leh, aisanmi leh Kaldaimite, kumpipa mang hilh ding a sap ding thu a pia hi. Huchi in a honglut ua kumpipa ma ah a hong dingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n a kiang uah, “Mang ka nei a, mang thei ding in ka lungsim a buai mahmah hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kaldai mite’n kumpipa kiang ah Suria pau in, “Aw kumpipa, tangtawn in dam in; na sikhate na mang hilh in, a hilhchetna ka ensak ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a dawng a, “Kaldai mite kiang ah, hiai thil kei a kipan a paikheta; mang leh a hilhchetna ka kiang a n’on theihsak kei ua leh atnen in na om ding ua, na innte uh ekvum a honghi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh mang leh a hilhchetna n’on theihsak ua leh kei a kipan in thilpiakte leh kipahman leh nakpitak a zahtakna na mu ding uh; huaiziak in mang leh a hilhchetna hon ensak un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nihveina ding in amau a dawng ua, “Kumpipa’n mang honhilh henla, kou a hilhchetna ka ensak ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a dawng a, “Kei a kipan hiai thil a paikheta chih na muh ziak un, hun hihsau tum na hi uh chih ka theitel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh mang ka kiang a n’on theihsak kei uleh, nou ading in dan khat kia a om; hun a kikhen tan a, ka ma a thu zuau leh sia gelkhol na hih ziak un; huaiziak in mang honhilh unla, a hilhchetna n’on ensak thei uh chih ka thei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kaldai mite’n kumpipa ma ah a dawng ua, “Kumpipa thudot ensak thei leitung ah kuamah a omkei; kumpipa hiam, toupa hiam, vaihawmmi kuamah in mitkhialdawitawi kuamah hiam, bummi kuamah hiam, Kaldai mi kuamahmah huchibang thu a dot ngeilouh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa thildeih vangtak ahi, pathiante a omna uh sa toh hiloute chih louhngal, midang kuamah in kumpipa ma ah huai a ensak theikei ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiai ziak in kumpipa a heh mahmah a, a thangpai tuntuna, Babulon mi pil tengteng hihmang ding in thu a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in thupiak piakkhiak ahita a, mipilte thah ding ahi ta uhi; Daniel leh a lawmte thah ding in a zong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Daniel in kumpipa veng sepaih zaheutu Ariok, Babulon mipilte that ding a kuankhe pa kiang ah thuhilhna leh thupil toh dawnna a kiksak hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ariok kumpipa sepaih zaheutu a dong a a kiang ah, “Bangdia kumpipa a kipan thupiak huchitel a kin ahia?” a chi hi. Huchi in Ariok in Daniel kiang ah a thil omdan a theisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Daniel a lut a, amah adia hun sehsak ding in kumpipa a ngen hi, huchi a a hilhchetna kumpipa a etsak theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Daniel a inn ah a pai a, Hananiah, Misael, Azariah, a lawmte kiang ah huai thil a theisakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi a amaute’n hiai thuguk tanchin a van Pathian chitnate a nget theihna ding un; huchi a Daniel leh a lawmte Babulon a mipilte a lakte toh a manthat louhna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in zan mengmuhna ah Daniel kiang ah thuguk taklat in a omta hi. Daniel in van Pathian a phat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Daniel in a dawng a: Tangtawn tangtawn in Pathian min phat in om hen; pilna leh hatna amah a ahi, a chi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aman hunte leh hunbite a hih lamdang a; kumpipate a suankhia, kumpipate a tung khia a; mipilte kiang ah pilna a pia a, theihsiamna theite kiang ah theihna a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thil thukte leh thil gukte a taklang a, mial a om bang ahia a thei a, a kiang ah khovak a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na tung ah ka kipak a, k’on phat hi, Aw nang ka pipute Pathian, pilna leh hatna hon pepa, nang k’on nget uh ka kiang ua hon theisakpa’n; kumpipa thu ka kiang uah n’on theisakta ngal a, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huaiziak in Daniel, kumpipa’n Babulon mipilte hihse dia a sehpa, Ariok kiang ah a hoh a; a vahoh a a kiang ah hichibang in a chi hi; “Babulon mipilte hihmang ken; kumpipa ma ah hon pilut inla, kumpipa kiang ah a hilhchetna ka ensak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in Ariok in kintak in kumpipa ma ah Daniel a pilut a, a kiang ah hichibang in a chi a; “Judah saltangte lak ah mi khat ka mu a, aman kumpipa kiang ah a hilhchetna a theisak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a dawng a Daniel kiang ah, a min Belteshazzar hiven, “Mang ka neih n’on theisak thei in, a hilhchetna n’on theisak thei ding maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Daniel in kumpipa ma ah a dawng a, “Thuguk kumpipa’n a nget mi pil hi in, aisanmite hileh, kumpipa kiang ah a ensak theikei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Himahleh van ah Pathian a om a aman thugukte a taklang hi; ni nanung lam a bang om ding ahia chih kumpipa Nebukadnezzar kiang ah a theisak hi. Na lupna tung a na lutang mengmuhna leh na mang hiaite ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nang na hihleh aw kumpipa na lupna tung ah na lungsim sung ah na ngaihtuahnate a hongom ua; tunung chiang a bang ahia hongom ding thu: huan amah thugukte na kiang a taklangpa’n bang ahia hongom ding na kiang ah a theisakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Himahleh kei bel pilna mihing dangte sang a pilna ka neih tamzawk ziak a hiai thuguk ka kiang a taklat ahi kei a; himahleh a hilhchetna kumpipa kiang a theihsak a hih theihna ding leh nang na lungtang ngaihtuahte na theihna ding ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Aw kumpipa ngai in, nang milim thupitak na muta hi. Hiai milim hattak mai, a vakna thupi mahmah, na ma ah ading a; a mel a kihtakhuai mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hiai milim ahihleh a lutang dangkaeng hoih ahi a, a awm leh a bante dangka, a gil leh a pheipite dal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />a khete sik, a khezungte sik leh tungman khenkhat kihel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Suang khut a seklouh huai milim a khepek sik, leh tung deng a kitam nen sak dimdem tan in na mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huchi in sik, tungman, dal, dangkate leh dangkaeng toh a kitam nen khawm vek ua, nipi buhphual a buhsi bang mai a honghi ua; huchi in huih in huaite a mutmang a, huai milim dengzan suangpi pen mual thupi a hongsuak a, lei pumpi a dimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Hiai mang ahi a; kumpipa ma ah a hilhchetna ka gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aw kumpipa, nang kumpipate Kumpipa, van Pathian in a kiang a gam leh thilhihtheihna, hatna leh thupinate a piakna na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Koipeuh a mite tate a tenna uah, gam a sate leh van a vasate na khut ah a honpia hi; amau tengteng tung a vaihawm ding a a bawl dangkaeng lutang na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nang nung in nang sang a niamzaw gamdang khat a hong dingkhe ding; huchi in lalgam thumna dang, leitung tengteng a thunei ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Huan gam lina sik bang in a hat ding a, sik in a keknen sak a thil tengteng a nuaisiah bang in sik in hiaite tengteng a delhzan bang in, a keknen sak in, a delhzan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Huan khepek leh khezung na muhte, a khen belvelmi tungman leh a khen sik ahihleh gam hawmzak ahi ding a; himahleh asung ah sik hatna a om ding a, sik tungman toh helkhawm na muh bangtak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Huan khepek khezungte, a khen sik leh a khen tungman pen ahihleh, huchibang in gam hatna chiang nei, kitapna chiang nei a hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huan sik leh tungman kihel na muh pen ahihleh, mite chi toh amau a kitok hel ding uh; himahleh sik leh tungman a kigawm theihlouh bang in a ki kawikip kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Huai kumpipate damlai in van Pathian in gam suksiat a om ngeilou ding, a thuneihna midang kiang a nutsiat a om ngei samlou ding, a hon dingkhe sak ding a; himahleh hiai gam tengteng a kitam nen sak ding a, a suse vek ding, amah bel tangtawn in ading ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Huchi in Suangpi mual a kipan khut a sek louh hong omkhia a, sik, dal, tungman, dangka leh dangkaengte a kitam sak dimdem na muh pen ahihleh; tunung chiang a bang ahia hongom ding kumpipa kiang ah Pathian thupi in a theisakta hi: mang omzia theihsa ahi a, a khiakna a kichian hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Huaitak in Nebukadnezzar in a mai a leisi in Daniel a bia a, thillat leh gim namtui a kiang a lan ding in amau thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Daniel a dawng a, “Chihtaktak in na Pathian, pathiante Pathian leh, kumpipate Toupa leh, thugukte taklangpa ahi; hiai thuguk taklang ding a hihtheihna na neih ziak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n Daniel a liansak a, thilpiak tampi a pia hi, Babulon bial pumpi a heutu leh Babulon mipilte tengteng tung a ukpipa pen ding in a bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Daniel in Sadrak, Meshak, Abednego, Babulon bial thu leh la tung a koih ding in kumpipa kiang ah a ngen hi; himahleh Daniel zaw kumpipa kongpi ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebukadnezzar kumpipa’n dangkaeng milim, tong sawmguk a sang, tong guk a lian a bawl a; Babulon bial a Dura phaizang ah a dingsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nebukadnezzar kumpipa’n bial heutute, vaihawmmite, ukpipate, thukhenmi, sumkemmi, thudotmi, dansiammi leh bial vaihawmmi tengteng a kaikhawm a, Nebukadnezzar kumpipa’n a dinkhiak milim kipahpihna bawlna a hongpai ding in mi a sawlkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in bial heutu vaihawmmi, ukpipa, thukhenmi, sumkemmi, thudotmi, dansiammi leh bial vaihawmmi tengteng kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in a dinkhiak sak milim kipahpihna ah a hong kikhawm vek uhi; Nebukadnezzar adin khiaksak milim ma ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huaitak in tangkou ngaihtak in a kikou a, “Na kiang ua thupiak ahi, Aw mite, namte, paute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pengkul, tamngai, kaihging, gosem, nawtging, tumging pengnih nei leh tumging chichih ging na zak chiang un, puk unla, kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in adin khiaksak dangkaeng milim bia un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan kuapeuh a bia a puklou a, beloute meipi kuang zuazua sung ah huai hun mah a paihlut ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in huailai a mi tengteng in pengkul, tamngai, kaihging gawsem, nawtging leh tumging chichih ging a zak un, mi tengteng, namte, paute, a puk ua, kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in a tunkhiak dangkaeng milim a bia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchihlai in Kaldai mi kuate hiam a hongpai nai ua, Judah tuailaite a hong hekta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A dawng ua kumpipa Nebukadnezzar kiang ah, “Aw kumpipa, tangtawn in dam in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw kumpipa, nang thupiak na bawl a, mi chiteng in pengkul, tamngai, kaihging, gawsem leh nawtging, tumging pengnih neite leh, tumging chichih a zak chiang ua, a puk ding ua dangkaeng milim a biak ding uh chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kuapeuh puklou a belou, meipi kuang zuazua ah paihlut ding” chi in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babulon bial a thu leh la tung a na sehsa Judah kuate hiam a om ua, Sadrak, Meshak, leh Abednego; hiai mite’n, Aw kumpipa, nang a hon limsak kei ua; na pathiante na a semkei ua na dinkhiak sak dangkaeng milim leng a bekei uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Nebukadnezzar heh leh thangpai in Sadrak, Meshak, Abednego honpi ding in thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in hiai mite kumpipa ma ah a honpi ua, Nebukadnezzar in a dong a a kiang uah, “Aw Sadrak, Meshak leh Abednego, ka pathian nna nasep louh ua, dangkaeng milim ka tunkhiak na biak louh uh, na tup mawng uhia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin na kimansak unla chik hunpeuh a pengkul, tamngai, kaihging, gawsem, nawtging leh tumging pengnih nei leh tumging chichih ging na zak chiang un puk unla milim ka tunkhiak bia un, hoihtak in; himahleh na biak kei ua leh meipi kuang zuazua sung ah huai hunmah in a hon pailut ding uh; huchi in ka khut a kipan a nou hon hunkhe ding huai pathian kua hi ding ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sadrak, Meshak leh Abednego in a dawng ua kumpipa kiang ah, “Aw Nebukadnezzar, hiai thu ah k’on dawn uh a kiphamoh kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchibang ding ahihleh, Aw kumpipa, a na ka sep uh ka Pathian un meipi kuang zuazua a kipan kou a hon hunkhe thei hi, na khut apan a hon hunkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihkeileh leng, na thei in, Aw kumpipa, na pathiante na ka semkei ding ua, na dinkhiak dangkaeng milim leng ka be sam kei ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in Nebukadnezzar a thangpai petmah a, Sadrak, Meshak leh Abednego tung ah a mel putdan a kikheng hial hi; huaiziak in meipi a sat ngeina sang a mun sagih a a satsak ding in thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan a sepaihpawl lak a om mihat kuate hiam Sadrak, Meshak leh Abednego hen ding leh meipi kuang zuazua sung a pailut ding in thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in hiai mite a puansilhlai uh, samul puanak toh, puanak kawnggak nei leh a puansilh dangte utoh, mei kuang zuazua lak ah a pailutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa thupiak a khawk mahmah ziak leh meipi a sat mahmah ziak in huai mi Sadrak, Meshak leh Abednego domte meikuang in a hul lumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hiai mi thumte, Sadrak, Meshak leh Abednego te meipi kuang zuazua lak ah hensa in a puk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchih lai in Nebukadnezzar in lamdang a sa mahmah hi: kintak in a thoukhia a: amah thudotmite kiang ah thu a gen a, “Meilak ah mi thum hensa in i pailut uh ahi kei maw?” a chi hi. Amau a dawng ua kumpipa kiang ah, “Dik, Aw kumpipa” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aman a dawng a, “Ngai un, mi li phelsa a om, meilak a vak in ka mu a, bangmah a chi kei uh, a mi lina melputdan Pathian tapa a bang hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in Nebukadnezzar meipi kuang zuazua gei chin ah a hongpai a; thu a gen a, “Sadrak, Meshak leh Abednego, nou Pathian Tungnungpen sikhate, hong pawtkhia unla, hiai lam ah hongpai un” a chi hi. Huchi in Sadrak, Meshak leh Abednego, meilak ah kipan in a hong pawtkhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huan bial heutute, vaihawmmite, ukpipate leh kumpipa dantheimite, omkhawmte’n hiai mite, mei in a pumpi tung uah hihtheihna a neikei a, a luzang ua sam leng a kangdang kei a, a puansilh uleng a lamdang kei a, meigim leng a namkei uh chih a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nebukadnezzar in thu a gen a, “Sadrak, Meshak leh Abednego Pathian in a angel sawl a, amah muang a sikhate hunkhia a, kumpipa thu hihlamdang a, amau Pathian loungal pathian na a seplouh ua a biaklouhna ding ua pumpite uh pepa phat in om hen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huaiziak in thupiak ka bawl hi, michih, namchih, pauchih, Sadrak, Meshak leh Abednego Pathian gensiatna thil banghiam gente, atnen in a om dia, a innte uh ekvum a bawl ahi ding hi: hichibang a hunkhe thei pathian dang a omlouh ziak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n Sadrak, Meshak leh Abednego, Babulon bial ah a kaisang sakta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa, Nebukadnezzar mite tengteng, namte leh paute, lei tengteng a tengte kiang ah, na kiang uah lemna hihpun in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tungnungpen Pathian in keilam a a bawl chiamtehnate leh thillamdangte etsak kei ading in hoih leh a kilawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A chiamtehnate thupi hina mahmah e: a thillamdangte thilhihthei hina mahmah uh e: a gam tangtawn gam ahi a, a vaihawmna a khang a khang in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei Nebukadnezzar, ka inn sung ah ka khawl a, ka inpi sung ah ka lum hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hon lausak mang ka nei hi; ka lupna tung ah ngaihtuahnate leh ka lungtang mengmuhte’n hon hihbuai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in hilhchetna ka kiang a a kitheihsak ding un, Babulon mi pil tengteng ka ma a pi ding thupiak ka bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in mitkhialdawi tawite, bummite, Kaldaimite leh aisanmite a hongpai ua: a ma uah ka mang ka genta hi; himahleh a hilhchetna ka kiang ah a hon theisak theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh a tawptawp in ka ma ah, Daniel a min ka pathian min dungzui in Belteshazzar hiven, amah a Pathian siangthoute kha a omna ma ah mang ka genta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Belteshazzar, mitkhialdawi tawite heutupa, nang ah, Pathian siangthoute kha a om a, thuguk bangmah in nang a hon hihbuai kei chih ka theih ziak in ka mang a ka muh mengmuhte leh a hilhchetna honhilh in, ka chi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka lupna tung a ka lutang mengmuhte hichibang ahi: Ngai in, lei laizang ah sing khat ka mu a, huai sing sandan a thupi mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai sing a khangtou a, a honghat a, a sanna in van a suntou a, lei tengteng tawp huai ah a kimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nahte a hoih un, a gah pha mahmah a; huai ah mi tengteng ading in an a om hi: gamsate a nuailim ah a om ua, van a vasate a hiangte ah a teng ua, sa tengteng huai a kipan in a kivak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka lupna tung a ka lup in mengmuhte ka mu a, ngai in, van a kipan in vengmi siangthou khat a hong paisuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngaihtak in a kikou a, hichibang in a chi a: Sing phuk inla, a hiangte satkhia inla, a nahte singkhia inla, a gah thehzak in: a nuai a kipan gamsate leh a hiang a kipan vasate hawlmang in om uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh a bulsum leh a zungte pen hawi in, sik leh dal gui a henkhawm in, gam a loupa nou lak ah nutsiat in om hen. Van daitui in kawt henla, a tantuan lei a loupa lak a gamsate toh hi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan a tung a hun sagih a bei mateng mihing lungsim kikheng in a kiang ah gamsa lungtang piak hi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tungnungpen in mite gam ah vai a hawm a, a utna peuh kiang ah a pia a, mi niampente ading khesak chih mihingte’n a theihna ding un vengmite’n a genkhia ua, misiangthoute’n a phuangkhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiai mang kei kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in ka man hi: huan nang, Aw Belteshazzar, a hilhchetna genkhia in, ka gam a mipilte tengteng in ka kiang ah a hilhchetna a hon theisak theikei ua; himahleh nang na hihthei, nang a pathian siangthoute kha a om ziak in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Daniel, a min Belteshazzar in, sawtloukal lamdang a sa a, a ngaihtuahnate’n amah a patausak hi. Kumpipa’n a dawng a, “Belteshazzar, mang hiam a hilchetna hiam in nang hon patausak kei hen” a chi hi. Belteshazzar in a dawng a, “Ka toupa, mang nang hon mudahte lamthu hi henla, a hilhchetna na galte lam thu hileh maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na sing muh, hong khang a, honghat a, a sanna in van a suttouh a, hiai a kipan lei tengteng a kimuhna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A nahte a hoih a, a gah pha mahmah a, huai ah tengteng ading an a om a; huai nuai ah gamsate a teng ua, a hiang ah van a vasate a teng uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw kumpipa, huai hong khang a, honghat na muh, nangmah na hi a: na thupina a khang in, van a sun in, na vaihawmna leitawp pha in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Van a kipan a kumpipa’n vengmi siangthou hong paisuk a muh, Sing phuk inla, hihgawp in; himahleh a bulsum leh a zungte hawi in, sik leh dal gui a henkhawm in gam a loupa nou lak ah van daitui in kawt henla, huan a tantuan gamsate kiang ah hi in, a tung a hun sagih a bei matan, chih thu ahihleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw kumpipa, hiai a hilhchetna ahi, ka toupa kumpipa tung a hongtung Tungnungpen thupiak ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mite a kipan hawlkhiak in na om dia; gamsate kiang ah na khosa ding a, bawngtalte bang a loupa neksak in na om ding a; van daitui in na kawt ding a; na tung ah hun sagih a bei ding; mite gam ah Tungnungpen in vai a hawm a; a ututna kiang ah a pia chih na theih ma tan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huan sing bulsum leh a zungte nutsiat ding a thupiak a om pen ahihleh; van Pathian in vaihawm petmah ahi chih na theihkhit chiang in na gam nang kiang a piakkik ding genna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aw kumpipa, huaiziak in k’on thuhilh nang ading in pomtuak leh tagahte kiang a chitna etsakna in na thulimlouhnate tawpsan in; na hamphatna suksau a a omkhak zenzen leh a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hiai tengteng kumpipa Nebukadnezzar tung ah a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kha sawm leh nih bei in Babulon a kumpi Inpi sung ah a vialvak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kumpipa’n thu a gen a, hiai Babulon thupi, kumpipa tenna mun ding a, ka thilhihtheihna hatna leh ka thuneihna thupina ding a ka lam ahi kei maw? chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kumpipa kamsung a thu a omlai mahmah in, van a kipan aw a hong suakkhia a, “Aw kumpipa Nebukadnezzar, na kiang a thugen ahi: nang a kipan gam a paimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tungnungpen in mite gam ah vai a hawm a, a ututna kiang ah a pia chih na theih matan, mihingte a kipan in hawlkhiak na hi ding a, na tenna gamsate kiang ah ahi ding; bawngtalte bang a loupa ne ding a bawl in na om dia; na tung ah hun sagih a bei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huai bang thil a hongtungta a: mite a kipan a hawlkhiak in a om a; bawngtalte bang in loupa a ne petmah hi; a pumpi van daitui in a kawt a; a sam muvanlai multe a hong bang a, a chinte vasate chinte a hong bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huan nite bei in kei Nebukadnezzar in vanlam ah ka mitte ka suantou a, ka theihtheihnate ka kiang ah a hong kiknawn a, huchi in Tungnungpen ka pahtawi hi; amah tangtawn a om gige phat in ka zahtak hi: A vaihawmna tangtawn vaihawmna ahi a, a gam a khang a khang in ahi, chi in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huan lei a teng tengteng bangmahlou bang a ngaih ahi ua: huan van sepaih pawl leh lei a tengtengte lak ah a deihlam bang in a hihzel a: kuamah in a khut a len thei un, a kiang ah, Bangdia hih na hia? a chi theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huai laimah in ka theihtheihna ka kiang ah a hong kiknawn a; ka gam thupina, ka lalna leh hoihna ka kiang ah a hongkik a; ka midotte leh ka toupate’n kei a hongzong ua; huchi in ka gam ah kiptak in ka ding a, kei ding in thupina lian mahmah behlap in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huchi in kei Nebukadnezzar in van Kumpipa phat a pahtawi in ka zahtak a; a thilhih tengteng thutak ahi a, a lampite vaihawmna ahi a, kisatheitak a omte a hihniam thei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Belshazzar kumpipa’n a toupate lak a mi sang khat ading in Ankuang thupitak a bawl a, sang khatte ma ah uain a dawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Belshazzar in uain a cheplai in, a pa Nebukadnezzar in Jerusalem a om biakin a kipan a a lak dangkaeng leh dangka tuium belsuante kumpipa leh a toupate, a zite leh a meite’n huaite a a dawn theihna ding un honla ding in thu a pia hi;.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in Jerusalem a om Pathian inn, biakin a kipan a lakkhiak dangkaeng tuium belsuante a hon lata ua; kumpipa leh a toupate, a zite leh a meite’n, huaite in a dawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Uain a dawn ua, dangkaeng, dangka, dalsik, sing, leh suang pathiante a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai dakmah in mihing khutzungte a hong langkhia a, kumpipa Inpi bang pek tung, khawnvak koihna toh etdenna tak ah a lai a gelhta hi; kumpipa’n laigelhtu khut bangtan hiam a muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huailai in kumpipa mel a hong lamdang a, a ngaihtuahnate’n amah a patau sakta hi; a khut a khe a kipzou takei a, a khukte a kisat tuah nomnom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bummite, Kaldaimite leh aisanmite honpi un chi in nakpitak in kumpipa a kikou hi. Kumpipa’n thu a gen a, Babulon mipilte kiang ah, “Kuapeuh in hiai laigelh sim a, a hilhchetna hon ensak, puansandup silhsak ahi ding a; a ngawng kimvel in dangkaeng khainiang a awk ding a; gamsung ah vaihawmmi thumna ahi ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa mipilte tengteng a honglut ua: himahleh laigelh a sim theikei ua, a hilhchetna leng kumpipa a theisak theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Belshazzar a patau mahmah a; amah ah a mel a hong lamdang a; a khawnbawlte a lungzing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa leh khawnbawlte thu ziak in kumpinu Ankuangluina inn sung ah a honglut hi; kumpinu’n thu a gen a, “Aw kumpipa, tangtawn in hing in,” na ngaihtuahnate’n hon patausak kei henla, na mel leng lamdang kei heh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na gamsung a mi khat, amah a pathian siangthoute kha omna a om a; na pa damlai in vakna leh theihtheihna leh pilna, pathiante pilna bang, amah ah muh in a om; kumpipa Nebukadnezzar, kumpipa, na pa’n, amah mitkhialdawi tawite leh bummite, Kaldaimite leh aisanmite heutu in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lungsim hoihpen, theihna, theihtheihna, mangte hilhchetna, thugen haksa etsakna, ginlelhna hihvengna kumpipa’n Belteshazzar min a sakpa, huai Daniel mah ah muh in a om hi. Tuin Daniel kisam sak henla, aman hilhchetna ensak hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan Daniel kumpipa ma ah a honpi ua, Kumpipa’n thu a gen a Daniel kiang ah, “Daniel, ka pa’n Judah gam a kipan Judah salmat hon pilut na hi hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang ah pathian kha a om a, vakna leh theihtheihna leh pilna hoihpen nang a muh in a om chih na tanchin ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in mipilte, bummite, ka ma ah a hon pilut ua, hiai laigelh sim a, a hilhchetna ka kiang a theisak ding in; himahleh huai thil hilhchetna a ensak theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh hilhchetnate na bawl thei a, ginlelhnate na bawlhoih thei chih na tanchin ka za: tuin laigelh na sim theih a, a hilhchetna n’on hilh theih leh puansandup k’on silhsak ding a; na ngawng kimvel in dangkaeng khi na awk ding a; gamsung ah vaihawmmi thumna na hi ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Daniel in a dawng a kumpipa ma ah, “Na thilpiakte nangmah kiang ah hizaw henla, na kipahmante midang kiang ah pezaw in; ahi a, kumpipa kiang ah laigelh ka sim ding a, a hilhchetna amah ka theisak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw nang kumpipa, Tungnungpen Pathian in na pa Nebukadnezzar gam leh thupina, letna leh vaihawmna a honpia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huai amah a piak letna ziak in mi tengteng, namte, paute a ma ah a ling ua a lau uhi: a utut a that a, a utut a hinghawi hi; a utut a kaithou a, a utut a sawnniam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh a lungtang a hong kisaktheih a, kiuangsaktak a gamta a a lungsim hihkhauh a a omlai in, a mangtutphah a kipan suan in a om a, amah a kipan a thupina a lakheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan mite tapate a kipan a hawlkhiak in a om a; huchi in a lungtang gamsate a bang a bawl in a om a; bawngtalte bang a loupa a vak in a om a, a pumpi van daitui in a kawt a; Tungnungpen Pathian in mihing gam ah vai a hawm a, a ututte a tung ah ading khesak chih a hontheih matan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan nang a tapa, Aw Belshazzar, hiai tengteng na theih in leng na lungtang na niamkhiak kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh van Toupa dem in na kihihsang a; amau na ma ah Toupa inn a tuium belsuante na lasak a; nang leh na toupate, na zite leh na meite’n, huaite in uain na dawn uhi; dangka leh dangkaeng, dal, sik, sing leh suang pathiante, mu theilou, za theilou, thei theiloute bia in na phat a; Pathian a khut a na hatna a omna leh na lampite tengteng neipa na thupibawl kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in amah a kipan huai khut banghiam tan sawl in a hongom a, hiai laigelh gelh in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huan gelh a om laithu hiai ahi” MENE, MENE, TEKEL, UPHARSIN.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huai hilhchetna hiai ahi: MENE: Pathian in na gam a simta, a beisakta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />TEKEL; bukna a buk in na om a, na chingzou kei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />PERES; na gam hawm in a om a, Mid mite leh Persia mite kiang ah piak ahita hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in Belshazzar in thu a pia a, dangkaeng khainiang a ngawng kimvel in a oksak ua; amah tung ah thu a phuang ua, gamsung a vaihawmmi a thumna hi ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huai zan in Kaldai kumpipa Belshazzar thah in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mid mi Darias, kum sawmguk leh nih a upa in gam a tangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darias in a gam pumpi bial za leh sawmnih omsuak ding bial heutu za leh sawmnih gam tung ah a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan amaute tung ah, heutu lian thum, huaite lak ah Daniel khatna ahi a; huchi a hiai bial heutute’n huaite kiang ah thu a tut ua, kumpipa’n siatna a neihlouhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in hiai Daniel, amah a lungsim hoihpen a om ziak in, heutuliante leh bial heutute tung ah a kan a val a bawl in a om a; kumpipa’n gam pumpi tung ah amah koih a ngaihtuah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huailai in heutuliante leh bial heutute’n gam thu a Daniel demna ding a zawng uhi; himahleh amah mi ginom a hih ziak in thupatna ding in a diklouhna a mu kei ua, amah a diklouhna leh khelhna muh in a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in hiai mite’n, “Hiai Daniel demna ding bangmah i mu kei ding; a Pathian dan a amah demna ding i muh kei ngal leh” a kichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan hiai heutuliante leh bial heutute kumpipa kiang ah a kikhawm ua, a kiang ah hichibang in, “Aw, kumpipa Darias, tangtawn in dam in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gam heutulian tengteng, heutute leh bial heutute, dantheimite leh ukpipate, kumpi thuseh bawlkhiak a, khamna khauhtak bawl ding in a kikum khawm uhi. Huchi in mi kuapeuh, nang chih louh, Aw kumpipa, ni sawmthum sung a pathian hiam mihing hiam lak a ngetna a bawl leh, humpinelkai huangsung a paihlut in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin, Aw kumpipa, khamna hihkip inla, laigelh ah na min gelh in; huchi a Mid mite leh Persia mite dan bang a a kihihlamdan louhna ding in” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Darias in laigelh leh khamna ah a min a gelhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Daniel in laigelh ah min a kigelhta chih a theih in a inn sung ah a lut a; a dantan sung a a tawlette Jerusalem lam a hon ahi uhi, a khukdin a, ni khat in thumvei, huchi in a thum a, a malam a a hih bang in, a Pathian ma ah kipahthu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in hiai mite a kikhawm ua, Daniel a Pathian ma a thu ngen leh thum a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in a hongpai nai ua, kumpipa khamna tungtang kumpipa ma ah a hong genta uhi; “Aw kumpipa, nang chih louh michih kuapeuh in ni sawmthum sung a pathian hiam mihing hiam kiang a ngetna a bawl leh humpinelkai huangsung a paih ding ahi chih khamna ah na gelh ahi kei maw” a chi uhi. Kumpipa’n, “Mid mite leh Persia mite dan lamdang theilou bang in huai dan kiplai ahi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan amau a dawng ua kumpipa ma ah, “Huai Daniel, Judah saltang tate lak a in nang leh na min gelhna khamna leng a hon limsak kei hi, Aw kumpipa, ni khat in thumvei ngetna a bawl hi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiai thute a zak in, kumpipa a lungkim hetkei a, amah suaktasak ding in Daniel tung ah lungtang a nga a; amah hutkhiak tum in nitum tan a semgim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in hiai mite kumpipa kiang ah a kikhawm ua, kumpipa kiang ah, “Aw kumpipa, khamna hiam thuseh hiam kumpipa’n a hihkipsa hihlamdan theih a hihlouh Mid mite leh Persia mite dan ahi chih thei in” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n thu a pia a, Daniel a honpi ua, humpinelkai huangsung ah a paita uhi. Huan kumpipa’n thu a gen a, Daniel kiang ah, “A nna nasep gige na Pathian in a hon suaktasak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan suang khat a honla ua, huangsung gong ah a koih ua; kumpipa’n amah suaisawnna zungbuh leh a tapate suaisawnna zungbuh in suai a namta hi; Daniel tungtang thu a bangmah hihlamdan theih a hihlouhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa a inpi ah a pai a, anngawl in, tumging leh nopbawlna a khawlsak in a zanhak a; amah lah a ihmu theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa zingsang in beltak in a thou a, humpinelkaite huangsung lam ah kintak in a vahoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huangsung lam a Daniel kiang a a hongpai nailai in, kah aw in a kikou a; kumpipa’n thu a gen a Daniel kiang ah, “Aw Daniel, Pathian hing sikha, a nna nasep gige, na Pathian in humpinelkaite a kipan nang hon suaktasak thei hiam?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Daniel in kumpipa kiang ah, “Aw kumpipa, tangtawn in hing in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka Pathian in a angel honsawl a, humpinelkaite kam a hong chihsaka, a hon hihna kei uhi; amah ma a keimah a hoihna muh a a om ziak leh, Aw kumpipa nangmah ma a leng gilou ka hihlouh ziak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa nakpitak in a kipak a, huangsung a kipan Daniel lakhe tou ding in thu a pia hi. Huchi in Daniel huangsung a kipan in a lakhe tou ua, a Pathian a muan ziak in a tung ah bangmah natna a kimu kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huan kumpipa’n thu a pia a, Daniel hekte huai mite a honpi ua, humpinelkai huangsung ah a pai ua, amau, a zi leh tate uh; humpinelkaite’n a maute huangsung taw a hong tunma un a man ua, a guhte uh a hihnen vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Darias in mite tengteng, namte, paute lei tengteng a tengte kiang ah lai a gelh a; “Na kiang uah lemna hihpun in om hen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka gam sehthum tengteng ah Daniel Pathian ma ah mite a ling un a lau ding uh: Amah Pathian hing, tangtawn a omkip, a gam hihsiat ahi ngeikei ding a; a thuneihna a om den ding hi chi in thupiak ka bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aman a suaktasak a, a tankhia a, van leh lei ah chiamtehna leh thillamdangte a hih a; aman Humpinelkaite thilhihtheihna a kipan in Daniel a suakta sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchibang in hiai Daniel Darias vaihawm lai leh Persia mi Kura vaihawm lai in a thupi mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon kumpipa Belshazzar kum khatna kum in Daniel in a lupna tung a lup lai in mang a nei a, a lungsim ah mengmuh hong kilang a, mang tuh a gelh a a thute a kim in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Daniel in thu a gen a, “Zan a ka mengmuhna ah, ngai in, van huih lite tuipi thupi tung ah a hong nungkhia uh ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan tuipi a kipan sa thupi li, kibang lou chiat a hongpai tou ua
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A khatna humpinelkai a bang a, muvanlai kha a nei hi; huchi a ka et lai in a khate bohkhiak in a om ua; lei a kipan phottouh a mihing bang a khe nih a dinsak a om in; mihing lungsim a kiang a piak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan ngai in, sa dang, a nihna, vompi bang, a pang langkhat tung ah photkang in a om a; a kam sung ah a hate kikal ah nakguh thum a om a; hichibang in a kiang ah hilh in a om a, “Thou inla, sa tampi negai in” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai khit in ka en a, huan ngai in, sa dang khat, gialbem bang, a nungzang a vasa bang a kha li nei ka mu hi. Huai gamsa in lu li a nei a; a kiang ah thuneihna piak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hiai khit in, zan mengmuhna in ka mu a, ngai in sa lina, lauhuai leh thilhihthei, nakpi mahmah a hat; sik ha lianpite nei in a negai in a botnen a; a omlaite a khe in a chil hi. A ma a gamsa om tengteng toh a kibang kei hi; ki sawm a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kite ka ngaihtuah lai in, a lak uah ki dang a neu khat hongpou khia a, huai ma ah huai ki masa thumte a zung ua bohkhiak in a om uhi, hiai kineu ah mit, mihing mit bang, leh kam thil thupite gen a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi a ka et lai in, mangtutphah a hong kikoih a, mi khat Tangtawn a om gige a tung ah a tuta hi; a puansilh vuk bang in a ngou a, samul siang bang in a lu a sam a ngou hi; huai mangtutphah meikuang zuazua ahi a, huai a kangtalai khete meikuang lai bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meikuang luipi hongpawt a a ma a kipan hong paikhia a, a sang a sangte’n amah na a sepsak uhi; a ma ah sang sawm mun sang sawm ading ua: vaihawmna a tungkhia ua, laibute a hong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai ki in a thugen thupite ziak in ka en nilouh hi. Huchi a ka et lai in, huai gamsa thah in a om a; a pumpi hihsiat in a om a; meikuang a a paih dong uh ka en gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan sa dangte ahihleh a thuneihna uh lakmang in a om a: hunseh khat leh hun khat tan a hinna uh hihsau in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zan mengmuhna in ka mu a, ngai in, van meipite toh mi khat mihing tapa toh kibang a hongpai a, nite tang a tuan kiang mahmah ah a hong a, amah a ma chin ah a honpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan thuneihna, thupina leh gam piak in a om a; huchi a mi tengteng, namte, leh paute’n amah na a sepsak theihna ding un: a thuneihna tangtawn thuneihna ahi a, a mang kei ding, a gam hihsiat in a omkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei Daniel ahihleh ka sung ah ka lungsim a dah a, ka lutang mengmuh in kei a hon patausak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kiang nai a dingte lak a khat kiang ka zuan a, hiai tengteng thu ah thutak amah ka dongta hi. Huchi in huai thilte hilhchetna ka kiang ah a hon theisakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiai gamsa thupi lite etsak bel lei a hong dingkhe ding kumpipa lite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himahleh Tungnungpen misiangthoute’n gam a tang ding ua, tangtawn, tangtawn in, gam a neiden ding uhi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in sa lina, amaute tengteng toh kibang lou, kihtakhuai mahmah, a hate sik hi a, a chinte dal, nekhin a, botnen a, a omlaite a khepek a chil tungtang thutak theih ka ut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan ki sawm a lu zang a omte lak ah ki dang khat hong poukhia a, huai ma a ki thumte a pukna; huai ki mitte nei leh kam nei a thil thupite gen a, a latdan a lawite sang a hat tuakzaw pen tanchin ka thei nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi a ka et leh huai ki in misiangthoute dou in, gal a bawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nite Tang a tuan in Tungnungpen misiangthoute gum in thu a khen a, amau lalgam a neih masiah ua ding in amaute a zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in Sa lina pen leitung ah gam lina ahi ding a, huai gam tengteng toh a kibang kei ding a, lei pumpi a gai ding a, a sikden dia, a botnen ding a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huan ki sawmte ahihleh, hiai gam a kipan in kumpipa sawm a hong dingkhe dingte ahi ua: amau nung in a dang khat; amasa toh a kibang kei ding a, aman kumpipa thumte a zou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tungnungpen dem in a gense ding a, misiangthoute a nuaisiah ding hi: hunte leh dan khen ding a ngaihtuah dia; hun khat leh hunte leh hun kim khat bei masiah misiangthoute a khut a piak in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huaite zoh in vaihawmna a om ding a, a thuneihna lakmang ahi ding a, a tawptan a hihgawp ding leh suksiat in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huan leitung gam leh thuneihna leh van nuai pumpi nuai a gamte thupina, Tungnungpen misiangthoute kiang ah piak in a om ding: a gam tangtawn gam ahi a, a vaihawmnate’n amah na a sepsak un a thu a mang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hiai ah thu leh la tawpna a om hi. Kei Daniel ahihleh ka ngaihtuahnate’n nakpi’n hon hihbuai a, kei ah ka mel a mual hi; himahleh ka lungtang in huai thu ka kem khinkhian hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa Belshazzar vaihawm kum thum kum in, kei, Daniel kiang ah a tung a pen mah a hong kilat khitnung in mengmuhna ka kiang ah hong kilang nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka mengmuhna ah hichi ahi a, Elam bial a Susan inpi ah ka om a; huan mengmuhna in Ulai lui kiang ah om in ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in ka dak leh ngai in, huai luigei ah belamtal khat ki nih nei ading hi, a ki nihte a sau uhi. Himahleh khat sang in a dang pen a sau zaw a, a sau zaw a a pou nanung pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua Belamtal in a ki a si ding in tumlam, mallam, leh simlam nawt in ka mu hi; a ma ah sate ading theikei ua, a khut a kipan suaktasak thei leng kuamah a omkei uhi; himahleh amah deihlam in a hih a a hong thupi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi a ka ngaihtuah lai in, ngai in, lei pumpi tawnsuak in tumlam a kipan in keltal khat lei sukhalou in a hongpai a, huai kel in a mitte kikal ah ki minthang khat a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Belamtal ki nih nei lui malam ading a ka muh kiang ah a hongpai a, a thilhihtheihna toh heh in amah a delhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Belamtal kiang chin ah a hongpai ka mu a, a tung ah nakpi’n a thangpaita a, belamtal a boh a, a ki nihte a hihtan a; huchi in belamtal in amah a dinna ding thahatna a neita kei hi; Lei ah a sipuk a, amah a chil a; a khut a kipan belamtal suakta sak ding kuamah a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keltal nakpi mahmah in a kiliansakta a: huchi a a hatlai in, huai ki thupi a kitan a; a mun ah ki li minthang vanhuih lite lam ah a hong suakkhe tou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan huai kite lak a ki neu thupi mahmah khat, simlam, suahlam, leh gam kilawm lam nga in a hong khangkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in van sepaihte bang hial in a hong thupi mahmah a; aksi honte lak a khenkhatte lei ah a pai khesuk a, amau a chil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi, van sepaihte Toupa tung nangawn ah a kiliansak a; amah a kipan in niteng haltum thillat a lamang a, a Mun Siangthou a pai khesuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan tatlekna ziak in haltum thillatte toh van sepaihte amah kiang ah piak in a om ua; huchi in thutak lei ah a paikhia a, a sep leh bawlte ah a lohching hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in misiangthou khat in misiangthou dang khat kiang ah “Hiai mengmuhna a kimu tatlekna mulkimhuai in niteng haltum thillat bang tan luahtou ding a, mun siangthoupen leh van sepaihte a khenuai a bang tan nuaisiah a omsak ding ahia” a chih ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan aman ka kiang ah, “Nitaklam leh zinglam sang nih leh za thum sung tan in; huai chiang in munsiangthoupen silsiang ahi ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan hichi ahi a, kei, Daniel in ka mengmuh lai in, theihchet ka na tum a; huchi in ka ma ah mihing kibatpih bang a hongding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan Ulai luipiau kikal ah, mihing aw kikou a, “Gabriel, hiai mipa mengmuhna theichiansak in” a chih ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchibang in ka dinna mun naih in a hongpai a; huchi a a hongpai lai in, ka lauta a, ka mai in lei ka si hi: himahleh aman ka kiang ah, “Aw mihing tapa, mengmuh lah huntawp ading ahi a, theisiam in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan kei a hon houpih lai in, leilam nga in nakpitak in ka ihmu ta a: himahleh a honkhoih a, a hon dingtang sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan aman, “Ngai in, thangpaihna huntawp lam a bang ahia hongom ding k’on theisak ding: huntawp sehsa ading lah ahi ngal a, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Belamtal na muh ki nih nei, Media leh Persia kumpipate ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan huai keltal huham Grik kumpipa ahi: a mitte kikal a om ki thupi kumpipa khatna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan a kitan pen munluah ki lite ahihleh, huai nam a kipan in gam li hong dingkhe dingte ahi ua; himahleh amau bang in thilhihtheihna a neikei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan a gam vaihawm huntawpna uah, talekmite a honghat mahmah chiang un, kumpipa lauhuai melpu, zuau a zekhem siam khat ading khe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in a thilhihtheina a hat dia, himahleh amah mah thilhihtheihna hilou in; siatna lamdangtak a tun dia, a thilhih khempeuh a lohching ding hi: huchi in mi hatte leh misiangthoute a hihse gawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huan amah danzui in zekhemna nasep ah a lohching zel ding hi: huan a lungtang a kiliansak ding a, mitampite bit a kisaklai un a hihse ding a; kumpipate Kumpipa dou ding in a kisa ding; himahleh mihing khut hilou in hihkhap in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huan nitaklamte leh zingsang lam toh kisai mengmuhna kigen a dik ahi; himahleh a hongtung ding ni tampi ading a hihlai ziak in hiai mengmuhna khak bikbek in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi in kei Daniel ka sibup a; ni bangzah hiam ka china hi; ka thou a, kumpipa nna ka sem a hiai mengmuhna lamdang ka sa hi, himahleh kuamah in a theisiam kei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Media mi, Ahasueras tapa Darias, Kaldaite gam a kumpipa ding a bawl, vaihawm kum khatna in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A vaihawm kum khatna kum in kei, Daniel in laibute a kipan Jerusalem hihsiatna in kum sawmsagih daih ding ahi chih zawlnei Jeremiah kiang a Toupa thu hongtung tanchin a kipan in ka theisiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa Pathian lam ah ka mel ka koih kip a, thumna leh thilngette, anngawlna leh saiip puansilh in, vutlak a tu in Toupa Pathian kiang ah ka ngen ngutngut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan Toupa ka Pathian kiang ah ka thum a, thupha ka tawi hi, “Aw Toupa , Pathian thupi leh mulkimhuai, Nang hon it a na thupiakte zuite tung a thukhun leh chitna vom;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka khialta ua, hoihlou tak in ka gamtang ua, gilou tak in ka na hihta ua, ka hel ua, na thuseh leh na vaihawmte ka na lehngat santa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka kumpipate uh, ka vaihawmtute uleh ka pipute uh leh gam a mi tengteng kiang a na min a thugen, na sikha zawlneite thu leng ka na ngaikhe sam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Aw Toupa , diktatna nang a ahi a, himahleh tuni bang in, kou a bel zahlakna leh buaina ahi; Judah a mite, Jerusalem a tengte, Israel tengteng, a nai leh gamla a omte, na tung a a tatlekna ziak un amaute gam tengteng ah delhzak in ka om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Toupa , ka kumpipate, ka vaihawmte uh, ka pipute uh leh kou hon suangtute’n na tung a dikloutak a a khelh ziak un zahlakna in honkhuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah tung ah na helta mahle ung chitnate leh ngaihdamte Toupa ka Pathian uh a ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa ka Pathian uh aw leh a dante a om ding a a sikha zawlneite zang a ka ma ua hon na koihsakte ka na mangta kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ahi, Israel tengteng in na dan a tatlek san ua, a hilou lam ah a pial ua, na aw a manlouhna ding un; huaiziak in na tung a ka hihkhelhte ziak in Mosi, Pathian sikha dansung a gelh a om kichiamna hamsia ka tung ah sunbuak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan koute demna leh ka tung ua vaihawmmite demna thute leh ka tung ua siatna thupitak in a hihkip khinta hi; Jerusalem tung a kihih bang van nuai pumpi ah lah a kihih ngei ngalkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosi dan sung a gelh a hih bang in, hiai siatna tengteng ka tung uah a hongtung hi; huchipi in leng ka thulimlouhnate uh kiheisan a, na thutak a theihkhen theihna ka neih theihna ding un Toupa ka Pathian uh deihsakna ka ngen naikei lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa ka Pathian uh a thilhihte tengteng ah a diktat gige man in, Toupa’n thil hoihlou en gige in, Ka tung uah a hon tungsakta hi; hinapi in kou lah a aw ka na mangta kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Huan tuin, Aw Toupa ka Pathian uh, khut hattak a na mite Aigupta gam a kipan pikhepa leh tuni bang a minthanna kimuhpa, tuni bang in ka khialta ua, gilou tak in ka na hihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Toupa , k’on ngen hi, na diktatna tengteng ziak in, na hehna leh thangpaihna, na khopi Jerusalem leh na mual siangthou a kipan kihei mangsakin; ka khelhnate uh ziak leh ka pipute uh thulimlouhna ziak in, Jerusalem leh na mite lah ka kim ka vel ua omte tengteng simmawh a hong hita ngal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin, Aw ka Pathian uh, na sikha thumna leh a thilngette ngaikhia inla, Toupa ziak in, a segawpsa na mun siangthoupen tung ah na mel vaksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, na bil hondoh inla, za in; na mitte hak inla, na min a kilou na khopi siatgawpnate en in; ka diktatna ziak un na ma a hiai ka thilngetnate uh lan ka hi ngal kei ua, na chitna thupite ziak in ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Toupa, za in, Aw Toupa ngaidam in, Aw Toupa, ngaikhia inla hih in; hal ken; nangmah ziak mahmah in, Aw ka Pathian, na khopi leh na mite nang min pute ahi uhi! a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi a thu ka gen a, ka thum a, ka khelhna leh ka mi Israel khelhna thupha ka tawi a, Toupa ka Pathian ma a ka Pathian mual siangthou ading a thilngetna ka piaklai in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi, thumna a thu ka gen lai in, Pasal Gabriel, a chil a mengmuhna a ka muh pa, kintak a leng dia bawl a om in, nitaklam thillat hun ding in a hong khoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan a hon thuhilh a, a hon houpih a, “Aw Daniel, theihsiamna a siam mahmah a honbawl ding in tuin ka hong paikhia hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na thilngetna kipat phet in a dawnna piak ahi; nang hilh ding a hongpai ka hi, nakpitak a it lah na hi ngal a; huaiziak in thu ngaihtuah inla, mengmuhte theisiam in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Na mite leh na khopi siangthou ading in tatlekna hihbeina ding, khelhnate tawpsakna ding leh thulimlouhna adia kilemna bawlna ding, tangtawn diktatna laklutna ding leh mengmuhte leh genkholhnate khakkhum bikbekna ding leh a siangthoupen thaunilhna ding in na tung ah nipikal sawmsagih hunseh leh thupiak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huaiziak in thei inla, theikak in, Jerusalem tung ding nawn ding leh lam dia thupiak a paikhiak a kipan sathau nilh a om pa, vaihawm tan in, nipikal sagih ahi ding; huan nipikal sawmguk leh nih sung in hun haksa mahmahte a kongzing leh bukna guam toh a kilam nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nipikal sawmguk leh nih khit chiang in sathau nilh a om pa satkhiak in a om ding a, bangmah a neikei ding hi; huchi in a hongom ding vaihawmpa leh mite’n khopi leh Mun Siangthou pen a hihse ding ua; huntawpna tuikhang bang in a hongtung ding hi, a tawp dong in kidouna leh siatgawpnate a om ding a guankholhsa ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi in nipikal khat ading in tampi toh thukhun khauh tak a bawl ding a; nipikal kimkhat ading in kithoihna leh thillat a tawpsak ding hi; munsiangthou ah mulkimhuai leh kihhuai a tungkhe ding a; amah tung a tung dia guankholhsa huntawp leh thangpaihna a tung ah sunbuak a hihtan a om ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Persia kumpipa Kura vaihawm kum thumna ah Daniel, a min Belteshazzar kiang ah thu khat a hong kihil hi; huan huai thu a tak ahi a, kidouna thupi mahmah thu ahi; huchi in huai thu a theisiam a, mengmuhna theihsiamna a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huailai in kei Daniel in, nipikal pumpi kal thum ka sun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tanghou lim ka ne kei a; sa hi in uain hileh ka kam ah a lut kei a; sathau leng, nipikal thum a tunkim masiah ka nilh hetkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan kha masapen ni sawmnih leh li ni’n, lui lian, Hiddekel pang ah ka ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka dak a ngai in, mi khat puanmalngat silh, a kongte Uphaz dangkaeng siang a gak ka mu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A pumpi leng beril suang bang ahi a; a maitang khophia bang ahi; a mitte meisel kuangpha a bang a, a bante leh a khepekte a dal nawttet a bang a; a thugen ging mipi aw a bang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in kei Daniel kia in mengmuhna ka mu hi; ka kiang a om mite’n lah huai mengmuhna a mu ngalkei ua; himahleh a tung uah nakpi a linna a hongtung a, kibu ding in a taikekta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in kei kia a nutsiat in ka om a; hiai mengmuhna thupi ka muta hi; huchi in kei ah hatna a om nawnta kei a; ka kilawmna kei ah siatna a hongsuakta a; hatna ka neita kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hina pi in ka muh mipa aw ka za a; a thute ka ngaihkhiak lai in, a khup in ka mai lei lam nga in nakpitak in ka ihmu hithit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai in, khut in a honkhoih a; ka khuk leh ka khutpek leh ban ah honlen in ling kawmkawm lai a hon phong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan aman ka kiang ah, “Aw Daniel, nang nakpitak a it a ompa, na kiang a ka thugente theisiam in dingtang in; na kiang a sawl a ompa ka hi” a chi a; hiai thu ka kiang a a genlai in, ling kawm in ka dingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, “Lau ken, Daniel, theisiam ding leh na Pathian ma a kiniamkhiak ding a, na lungtang na koihkip ni masapen a kipan, na thugente zak in a om hi; na thugente ziak a hong ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh Persia gam kumpipa’n ni sawmnih leh khat kei hondal hi; himahleh ngai in, Persia kumpipa kiang ah hentang a ka om nilouh ziak in Mikael, vansawltak lianpen kei hon panpih ding in a hongpai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in ni nanung lam chiang a na mite tung a hongtung ding bang ahia chih nang hon theisiam sak dia hongpai ka hi; mengmuhna tunung ni tampi a hong tungding a hilai hi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan hiai thute bang a ka kiang a aman thu a gen khit in ka mai leilam ka ngat a a, ka pau theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan ngai in, mi khat mite tapate toh kibang in ka mukte a hon khoihsak a; ka kam ka a, thu ka gen a, ka ma a dingpa kiang ah, “Aw ka Toupa , mengmuhna ziak in lungkhamnate ka tung ah hong kibung a, hatna ka neikei hi” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangchi in ahia ka Toupa sikha in ka Toupa a houlimpih theih ding? Kei ah thahatna a omkei a, nak leng nak lahsim ka hi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huailai in mi khat mihing toh kibang in a honkhoih nawn a, a hon hatsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan aman, “Aw nakpitak a it mipa, lau ken; na kiang ah muanna om hen, hattak in om in; ahi, hattak in om in, a chi hi. Aman ka kiang a thu a genkhit in, ka hatta hi; Ka Toupa’n thugen heh, ka chi a; nang n’on hatsakta ngal a” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman, “Na kiang a bang ding a hongpai ka hia na thei hia? Tuin Persia gam makaipa kidoupih ding in ka kiknawn ding hi; huchi a ka paikhiak chiang in, ngai in, Grik makaipa a hongpai ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh thutak laibu sung a kigelh nang k’on hilh ding hi: Na makaipa Mikael chihlouh kuamah hiaite kalh a kei hon doupih a omkei uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan kei ka hihleh, Mid mi Darias kum khatna kum in, amah hihkip ding leh hihhat ding in ka ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in thutak k’on ensak ding hi. “Ngai in, Persia ah kumpipa thum a hong dingkhe lai ding ua; a lina pen amaute tengteng sang in nakpitak in a hausa zaw ding hi; huchi a a hauhna ziak a a honghat mahmah chiang in, Grik dou ding in mi tengteng a tokthou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan kumpipa hattak a hong dingkhe ding a, thuneihna thupi toh vaihawm ding leh a deihdan a hih ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hong dinkhiak chiang in, a gam a kek ding a, van huih lite lam ah a hawmzak ahi ding; amah suan hilou in vai a hawm dia, himahleh amah thilhihtheihna a neikei ding; a gam bohkhiak leh midangte kiang a piak in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Huchi in simlam kumpipa a hat ding a, a sepaih heutu khat amah sang in a hatzaw ding a, gam a nei ding a; a vaihawmna thupi ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan kum bangzah hiam nung in, a kizom khawm ding ua; simlam kumpipa tanu mallam kumpipa kiang ah kituahna bawl ding in a hongpai dia; himahleh hiai kizopna in hunsawt a daihkei ding hi; huai ni’n amah vengmite leh a pa leh amah kithuahpihpa leng piakkhiak in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh a zung a kipan a hiang selnou mun ah mi khat a hong dingkhe ding a; huai tuh sepaih pawl kiang ah a hongpai dia; mallam kumpipa kulhpi sung ah a lut dia; amaute dou in thil a hih ding a, a vualzou ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in a pathiante u leng, a milim sun te utoh, huan a dangka leh dangkaeng tuium-belsuan hoihte utoh, Aigupta ah aman a sal in a lakik ding hi; huan mallam kumpipa a kipan kum bangzah hiam a kidang koih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan simlam kumpipa gam ah a hongpai dia, himahleh amah gam lam ah a kiknawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Huchi in a tapate’n a dou ding ua; sepaih thupi tampi a kaikhawm ding ua; huaite a dimlet in a hong kuan ding ua, a paisuak ding uhi; huan a kiknawn ding ua, amah kulh tan pha hial in a dou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in simlam kumpipa a heh mahmah ding a, a hong kuankhe dia mallam kumpipa a kidou pih ding hi. Mallam kumpipa’n sepaih a tam a tam tungkhe mahleh mipite a khut a piak in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan mipite pimang in a om ding ua, a lungtang sansak in a om ding hi; huchi in sang sawm tampi a puksak ding a, himahleh a vualzou kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Huan mallam kumpipa a hongkik dia, a ma sang a thupizaw mipi a hon tungkhe ding hi; kum bangzah hiam nung in sepaih hon thupi leh van tampi toh a hong kuan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan huai hunte ah simlam kumpipa dou in mi tampi a dingkhe ding uh; na mite lak a hiamgam tate leng mengmuhna hihkip ding in a hong ki domkang ding uh; himahleh a puk ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchibang in mallam kumpipa a hong dia, panmun a bawldia, khopi kulhneite a la ding; simlam sepaihte leh a mi telte’n leng a nang kei ding ua, nan na ding in hatna leng a omkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh amah dou dia hong paipa’n amah deihlam bang in a hih ding a, a ma ah kuamah ading kei ding; gam thupi ah ading dia, a khut ah siatna a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A gam pumpi thahatna toh hongpai a tum chiltel ding a, simlam kumpi gam toh kizopna a bawl ding in a tanu a kiang ah a pe ding hi; himahleh a thilsawm a lohsam ding a, a phattuam pih sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiai khit in tuikulh lam a nga dia, gam tampite a zou ding hi; himahleh gamdangmi sepaih heutu khat in amah a zou dia, a mi simmawh na a tawp sak ding; ahi, a mi simmohna amah tung ah a kibungsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in amah gam kulhpi lam ah a kiknawn dia; himahleh a kisuipai in a puk dia, muh in a om nawn takei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Huai hun chiang in amah mun ah mi khat a hong dingkhe dia, aman a gamsung puahna ding in leiman khonpa gam thupi tan a palsuak sak dia; himahleh ni tamlou zoh in hehna leh kidouna hilou in hihsiat in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Huan a mun ah mi zahpihhuai khat a hong dingkhe dia, huai lalgam in zahtakna a piaklouhna pa uh; himahleh mite bit a kisaklai un a hongpai ding a, maitang phatna in gam a la ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan sepaih honte a ma ah taihmang in a om ding ua, sepaih honpite leh thukhun heutupa leng a hih manthat in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in amah toh pankhawmna kibawl nung in lepchiahtak in thil a hih ding a; a hong kuantou dia, nam neuchik toh honghat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gam khen a hausa mahmah namte a bitlai pen un dou ding in a kuantou ding a, a pipute’n a hih zohlouh uh a hon hihzou dia, a pipute’n leng a hih ngeilouh uh a lak uah samat leh gallakte leh vante a hawmzak dia, ahi, kulhnei khopite dou ding in a guksawm ding hi, himahleh hun khat kia a daih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Huan sepaih thupi toh simlam kumpipa dou ding in a thilhihtheihna leh a hatna a tokthou ding a; huchi in simlam kumpipa’n sepaih a thupi a thupi leh hat in kidouna ah a dou thuk ding hi; himahleh amah siatna ding a a guk a thusawm a hih ziak in ading zoukei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi, a an nete’n amah a hihmang ding ua, a sepaihte phiatmang in a om ding uhi; huchi in tampi thah in a puk ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa nihte a hih uleh gilou lungtang pukawm in dohkan khat ah a tukhawm ding ua, zuau in a kikhem tuah ding uhi; himahleh huntawp a tung ding a sehsa a hih ziak in a lohching kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in simlam kumpipa tuh gallak thupi toh a gam lam ah a kiknawn dia; huchi in a lungtang in thukhun siangthou a dou ding; a utut a hih ding a amah gam ngei ah a kiknawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Hun sehsa ah a kiknawn dia, simlam ah a hongpai dia; himahleh hun masa hiam hun nanung bang ahi kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amah dou dia Kittim longte hongpai ding a hih ziak in; huaiziak in a dah ding a, a kiknawn dia; thukhun siangthou dou in a hehna a sungbaw ding a a utut a hih ding hi; a hong kiknawn ngeingei dia, thukhun siangthou nungngat sante deihsakna a lak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amah lam ah sepaihte a pang ding ua, mun siangthoupen kulhpi mahmah a buahsak ding ua; haltum thillat gige a hihbei ding ua a hihgawp ding in kihhuai a tungkhe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huan thukhun nungngatsante maitang phatna in a gilou tak in, aman a hekkawi dia; himahleh mi a Pathian uh theite bel a hat ding ua, thilhih minthangpente a hih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huchi in mite lak a theihsiamna neite, ni tampi sung, namsau leh meikuang, saltanna leh loh in a om mahle uh, mi tampi a thuhilh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huan a puk chiang un, panpihna tawmchik a ngah ding ua, himahleh maitangphatnate toh mi tampi in amau a pawlbawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A lak ua theihsiamna neite lak a mi khenkhatte, amaute bawlhoih ding leh, siangthousak ding leh amaute ngousak ding in, a puk ding uhi. Huntawp tanpha; hun sehsa ading a hihlai ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Huan kumpipa’n a deihlam bang in a hih dia; a kiliansak ding a, pathian chiteng tung ah a kikoih lian dia, pathiante Pathian dem in thil lamdangte a gen ding hi; thangpaihna a pichin matan a lohching ding; a tup chintensa a hih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A pipute pathiante leh numeite lunggulh leng a zahtak kei dia, pathian leng a zahtak kei ding; mi tengteng tung a amah kiliansak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Himahleh a man kulhpite pathian a pahtawi dia; a pi leh pute theih ngeilouh dangkaeng leh dangka leh suangmantamte leh thilthawnpiak manphate in amah a be ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Huan gamdang pathiante panpihna in kulh muanhuaipen pente a sual ding a; kuapeuh amah hihna pomte kiang ah zahna lianzaw a pe ding a, tampi tung a vaihawm ding in a bawl dia, man nei in gam a hawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Huan huntawp chiang in simlam kumpipa’n amah a kidou pih ding; mallam kumpipa amah dou ding in pingpei bang in, kangtalaite toh, sakol tung tuangmite toh, long tampi toh a hong kuan ding hi; huchi in gamte ah a lut dia, a dimlet dia a paisuak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Aman gam Siangthou leng a sim ding a, huchi in gam tampi zoh in a om ding hi; himahleh Edom leh Moab leh Ammon tate hausapate a khut a kipan suahtaksak in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Gam tampite tung ah a khut a zan ding a; Aigupta gam a suakta kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Himahleh dangkaeng leh dangka goute tung leh, Aigupta thil manphate tengteng tung ah thilhihtheihna a nei dia; huan Libia mite leh Ethiopia mite a kalsuanna ah a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Himahleh suahlam a kipan leh mallam a kipan a thuthang in amah a hihlau dia; thangpaihna thupi a mi tampi suse ding leh hihmang ding in a kuankhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Huan tuipi leh mual siangthou thupi kikal ah a Inpi puanbukte a kai ding a, himahleh amah a beina hongtung dia, kuamah in amah a panpih kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in Mikael, heutu thupi na mite tapate vengbittu a hong dingkhe ding hi. Leitung pianchil a kipan tu hun tanpha a om ngei nailou, mangbat hun a hongtung ding hi, huai hun chiang in laibu sung a gelh a om a, muhkhiak a om na mite hutkhiak in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan a lak ua mi tampi lei a leivui a ihmute a khanglou ding ua, a khen tangtawn hinna tang ding in, a khen zumna leh tangtawn simmohna tang ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pilte vansin vakna bang in a vak ding ua; mi tampi diktatna lam a heite tangtawn tangtawn in aksite bang in a tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh nang, Aw Daniel, huntawp tan ading in thute khakkhum bikbek inla, laibu bilh in; mi tampi a vialtai ding ua, theihna a pung ding.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huailai in kei, Daniel in ka en a, ngai in, midang nih, luigei hiai lam pang ah khat, luigei langlam pang ah khat ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan khat in puanmalngat a silh a, lui tuite tung a ompa kiang ah, “Hiai thillamdangte tawpna ding bangchi a sawt ahi ding?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Puanmalngat silh a, luituite tung a dingpa’n vanlam a a khut taklam leh a khut veilam liktou in, amah tangtawn a hingpa min a kichiam in hun khat, hunte leh hun kimkhat ahi ding a chih kazata hi; misiangthoute thilhihtheihna a suknen dimdem khit chiang un, hiai thil tengteng zoh ahi ding hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai ka za a, himahleh ka theisiam kei hi. Ken, “Aw ka Toupa , hiai thilte tawpna bang ahi ding?” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman, “Pai in, Daniel: thute khakkhum bikbek ahita ua, hun tawp matan a bilh bikbek ahita hi a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tampi a kihihsiangthou ding ua, a ngou ding ua, a kibawlhoih ding uh; himahleh giloute a gilou sem ding ua; giloute lak a kuamah in a theisiam kei ding uh; himahleh a pilte’n a theisiam ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in haltum thillat gige lakmang a om a, hihgawptu kihhuai tunkhiak a hongom ding hun a kipan, ni sang khat za nih leh sawmkua a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni sang khat za thum leh sawmthum leh nga ngak a, huai a hong a paite’n nuam a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh a tawp matan nang zaw pai in; na khawl ding a, nang adia piak na mun ah nite beina ah na goutan sang ding in na thounawn ding hi.
  </para>
</usx>
